compatible with each other.\n\n**Refuting the candidate**\n\nChecking whether graphs exist where radius is greater than the total domination number. Attempting to determine if a counterexample exists. The question is if there are graphs where `GraphCalc.radius G > GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber G`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/guard.sh\"","toolAction":"\"Viewing file\"","toolSummary":"\"View guard.sh\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
